1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,600
The tide is out!

2
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:05,850
Grab what glitters

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Just one more…?

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,300
Here comes the tide!

5
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,300
Run back!

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:15,000
Phew, just made it!

7
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:20,300
Build your island from what you bring back

8
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,600
Reach places you couldn't before

9
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,400
Until the empty island becomes a village

10
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:29,100
Low Tide Island — One thumb. Back before the tide.
